### 5. API Routes Detail

#### `POST /api/chat`
- Validates Supabase session cookie
- Accepts: `{ messages, patientRecord, patientId }`
- Builds system prompt with patient record
- Calls Gemini API with streaming
- Returns streamed text response
- Detects `UPDATE_ACTION:` in response → triggers frontend update modal

#### `GET /api/patient/[id]`
- Validates session
- Fetches patient by UUID from Supabase
- Returns full patient record JSON

#### `PATCH /api/patient/[id]`
- Validates session
- Accepts: `{ field, value }` or partial patient object
- Updates `patients` table in Supabase
- Updates `updated_at` and `updated_by`
- Returns updated record

#### `GET /api/patient/search`
- Accepts `?q=` param
- Queries: `WHERE id::text ILIKE '%q%' OR name ILIKE '%q%'`
- Returns array of matching patients (max 10)

